    "description": {
      "content": "REST APIs under the Microsoft Graph /copilot/ namespace that enable secure access to Microsoft 365 Copilot capabilities including retrieval, search, chat, interaction export, and change notifications. These APIs provide production-ready AI capabilities that work directly with Microsoft 365 data while respecting existing permissions, sensitivity labels, compliance controls, and policy enforcement.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Microsoft Graph Support",
